and CallResultData IntakeScreening: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-20 (IntakeScreeningController.cs, Models/v4/Calls/CallResult.cs; intake spam screening, M0326, plan §9). The contract test reads only paths; the components entry records the response fields Omni reads, for the next snapshot refresh to confirm. DispatcherDesk/*: Core dispatcher desk (dispatchers-on-duty-plan.md §4, M0324; hand-written from Models/v4/DispatcherDesk/DispatcherDeskModels.cs; SignOff, Heartbeat and SetAvailable take no body). CallResultData IndoorMapZoneId and IndoorMapFloorId (GetCall, GetActiveCalls) and EditCall's IndoorMapZoneId \"\" clearing the indoor location: Core develop working tree, 2026-11-23 (Models/v4/Calls/CallResult.cs, CallsController.cs; facility maps on the call form). Protocol library, acknowledgments and call step-through (ProtocolContent/*, ProtocolAcknowledgments/*), baseline training (Trainings/*) and the LMS learner (Lms/*, LmsRequirements/GetMyPaths, LmsPrograms/GetMyCertificationProgress): Core lms branch working tree, 2026-11-26 (ProtocolContentController.cs, ProtocolAcknowledgmentsController.cs, TrainingsController.cs, LmsController.cs, LmsRequirementsController.cs, LmsProgramsController.cs; protocols-training-knowledge-plan P1-P3, T0-T2). Round 10 A4 (Core lms branch working tree, 2026-11-26): Lms/GetMyAccess, GetCatalog, GetLessonPlaylist, GetLessonFile, SubmitSurvey (LmsController.cs), Trainings/GetTranscriptPdf, GetCertificate (TrainingsController.cs), TrainingReviews/RespondToSubmission (TrainingReviewsController.cs), Protocols/GetCategories (ProtocolsController.cs), ProtocolAcknowledgments/GetWeeklyQuestions and AnswerWeeklyQuestion (ProtocolAcknowledgmentsController.cs); none is on the QA Swagger as of 2026-11-26. Round 10 A5 (Core working tree, 2026-11-26): StepUp/Options and StepUp/Verify (StepUpController.cs, Models/v4/StepUp/StepUpModels.cs; the in-app step-up for signatures, acknowledgments, approvals and protected data), not on the QA Swagger 